# Manual file-copy backups (_pre_<change>.ext) — git is the version history
# now; these predate git in this repo and shouldn't keep growing inside it.
# NOTE: 118 pre-existing _pre_* files are already baked into the F0 commit
# (33f2bd1) since this pattern wasn't excluded yet at that point — un-bloating
# those would need a history rewrite, not done here. This only stops NEW ones.
*_pre_*

